        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Classic Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a faithful reimagining of the handheld puzzle classic, complete with a simple yet addictive gameplay loop: rotate and place falling blocks to clear lines and chase ever-higher scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring Classic and Speedrunning Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from classic game modes or test your reflexes and strategy in specialized speedrunning challenges designed to reward precision and consistency. Every mode is backed by detailed performance tracking, letting you review clears, efficiency, and progress over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keeping it Fresh</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To match the rising tension, the soundtrack adapts dynamically, ramping up in tempo and energy as the stakes grow higher. Whether you’re chasing a personal best or relaxing with a familiar favorite, Emerald Gallery: 2-Score brings a nostalgic look and modern polish to one of the most iconic puzzle formats ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What does the name &quot;2-Score&quot; mean?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Score&quot; is another way of saying &quot;20&quot;, so &quot;Two Score&quot; means &quot;40&quot;. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each line that you clear is 10 blocks, and a full clear (4 lines at once) is equal to clearing 40 blocks: 2-Score!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Classic Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a faithful reimagining of the handheld puzzle classic, complete with a simple yet addictive gameplay loop: rotate and place falling blocks to clear lines and chase ever-higher scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring Classic and Speedrunning Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from classic game modes or test your reflexes and strategy in specialized speedrunning challenges designed to reward precision and consistency. Every mode is backed by detailed performance tracking, letting you review clears, efficiency, and progress over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keeping it Fresh</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To match the rising tension, the soundtrack adapts dynamically, ramping up in tempo and energy as the stakes grow higher. Whether you’re chasing a personal best or relaxing with a familiar favorite, Emerald Gallery: 2-Score brings a nostalgic look and modern polish to one of the most iconic puzzle formats ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What does the name &quot;2-Score&quot; mean?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Score&quot; is another way of saying &quot;20&quot;, so &quot;Two Score&quot; means &quot;40&quot;. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each line that you clear is 10 blocks, and a full clear (4 lines at once) is equal to clearing 40 blocks: 2-Score!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A retro-inspired puzzle game reminiscent of the beloved classic handheld era. Featuring challenging gameplay across standard and speedrun modes, with dynamic music and in-depth stat tracking.",
        "supported_languages": "English",
